# 000700-000799/20170819T070102Z_796205318.wiki
zΔ⚡b|=30bf|+Edit script %3D%3D%3D%0AAn [[Ed (text editor)%7Cedit script]] can still be generated by modern versions of diff with the <tt>%2De</tt> option. The resulting edit script for this example is as follows:%0A%0A 24a%0A %0A This paragraph contains%0A important new additions%0A to this document.%0A .%0A 17c%0A check this document. On%0A .%0A 8,14c%0A compress anything.%0A .%0A 0a%0A This is an important%0A notice! It should%0A therefore be located at%0A the beginning of this%0A document!%0A %0A .%0A%0AIn order to transform the content of file ''original'' into the content of file ''new'' using <tt>ed</tt>, we should append two lines to this diff file, one line containing a <tt>w</tt> (write) command, and one containing a <tt>q</tt> (quit) command (e.g. by {{code%7Clang%3Dbash%7Cprintf "w\nq\n" >> mydiff}}). Here we gave the diff file the name ''mydiff'' and the transformation will then happen when we run {{code%7Clang%3Dbash%7Ced %2Ds original < mydiff}}.%0A%0A%3D%3D%3D |=3b7a|
# 000700-000799/20171007T135328Z_804207725.wiki
zΔ⚡b|=5ccb|+{{cite journal%7Clast1%3D|=7|-2|+%7Cfirst1%3D|=5|-4|+%7Ctitle%3D|=52|-5|+%7Cjournal%3D|=13|+%7Cdate%3DJune|=1|+1990%7Cvolume%3D|=2|-1|+%7Cissue%3D|=1|-3|+%7C|=1|-3|+ages%3D|=3|-1|+–|=3|+%7Cdoi%3D10|=1|-6|+1|=1|+45/|=1|+354|=1|+.|=1|-1|+3574}}|=b|+{{cite journal%7Clast1%3D|=4|-2|+%7Cfirst1%3D|=3|-4|+%7Ctitle%3D|=c|-1|+s|=9|-1|+d|=b|-1|+b|=7|-1|+t|=3|-1|+p|=7|-5|+%7Cjournal%3D|=8|-2|+: |=17|-1|+%7Cdate%3DJuly|=1|-1|+1991%7Cv|=2|-2|+ume%3D|=2|-1|+%7Cissue%3D|=1|-3|+%7Cpages%3D|=3|-1|+–|=3|-7|+%7Cdoi%3D|=1|-2|+0.1002/spe.43802|=1|-1|+0706}}|=11be|
